[label=hoja] A single sativa cannabis leaf with seven slender serrated fingers hangs from its stem against the rising sun, backlit so its veins glow like thin rivers of gold, a soft veil of smoke drifting across it, moody cinematic music-video still shot on an anamorphic lens, thick slow-moving smoke and haze, rich color grading with deep shadows, soft lens flares and fine film grain. Extreme close-up, the leaf filling the center of the frame against a blurred sunrise over misty green hills. Warm low sunrise backlight with a horizontal anamorphic flare, colors of glowing gold, deep green and hazy peach, no people, no text, no watermark.
[label=colinas] Thick white smoke curls slowly through a single beam of morning light in a dark room, its folds forming the layered ridges of misty mountains with a tiny sun glowing between the peaks, moody cinematic music-video still shot on an anamorphic lens, thick slow-moving smoke and haze, rich color grading with deep shadows, soft lens flares and fine film grain. Side view, the beam cutting diagonally from the upper left, the smoke mountains across the center, pure black around them. Warm gold light inside the beam, colors of gold, smoke white, soft blue and black, no people, no text, no watermark.
[label=chalice] A hand-carved wooden chalice pipe rests on a dark polished table, a thick column of smoke rising from its bowl and slowly turning into a spiral galaxy of glowing stars above it, moody cinematic music-video still shot on an anamorphic lens, thick slow-moving smoke and haze, rich color grading with deep shadows, soft lens flares and fine film grain. Low medium shot at table height, the chalice in the lower center, the galaxy filling the upper half against black. A warm ember glow from the bowl and cool starlight above, colors of ember orange, violet, deep blue and black, no people, no text, no watermark.
[label=frascos] Rows of amber glass apothecary jars filled with frosty green cannabis buds glow like lanterns on dark wooden shelves, thin smoke drifting between them, moody cinematic music-video still shot on an anamorphic lens, thick slow-moving smoke and haze, rich color grading with deep shadows, soft lens flares and fine film grain. Medium shot along the shelves at a slight angle, the nearest jar sharp on the right and the rows fading into soft bokeh on the left. Warm light glowing from inside each jar against the dark room, colors of amber, frosted green, honey gold and deep brown-black, no people, no text, no watermark.
[label=aros] Perfect smoke rings float slowly through a room filled with thick haze lit in red, gold and green, the rings catching the colored light as they drift toward the camera, moody cinematic music-video still shot on an anamorphic lens, thick slow-moving smoke and haze, rich color grading with deep shadows, soft lens flares and fine film grain. Wide shot at eye level, the rings at different depths, a dark window frame on the far wall. Three colored lights cutting through the haze from the left, center and right, colors of deep red, gold, emerald green and black, no people, no text, no watermark.
